: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"minimap_clic\" style=\"width:152px;display:block;text-align:right;font-size:14px\"><a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33529,32237,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (33529, 32237, 7)</a></div></center></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n</div>\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Personal Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"gender\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Gender</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unknown.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Pooka</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"job\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Job</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unknown.</div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">11.40.5409<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 25, 2017<br/>Summer Update 2017</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: NPCs <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20230826103335&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Peaceful_Pooka_f41d7c.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"npc-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see Peaceful Pooka.</div></div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-twbox-bubble\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NPC Bubble D\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NPC_Bubble_D_215d07.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>East of the south depot.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>You can play its game once every 20 hours. There are 7 possible outcomes with the same apparent probability.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-transcripts\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>To change these transcripts, edit the transcripts page for Peaceful Pooka.</i></dd></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hi</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Peaceful Pooka</strong>: Hello, mortal being! Do you want to play a game?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>yes</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Peaceful Pooka</strong>: Great! So listen: Pookas have the ability to know what others were dreaming recently. Depending on the dream you had last night, I will carry out something. ...<br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Peaceful Pooka</strong>: This can be something pleasant like a present ... or something annoying. Are you ready?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>yes</b><br/>\n<b>(possible outcome 1)</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Peaceful Pooka</strong>: A bit of fairy dust for the mortal being!<br/>\n(<i>Sparkles appear over you character</i>)<br/>\n<b>(possible outcome 2)</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Peaceful Pooka</strong>: You're a jinx!<br/>\n(<i>Curses you for 39 damage split in 11 turns</i>)<br/>\n<b>(possible outcome 3)</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Peaceful Pooka</strong>: You win! Take this present and have fun with it!<br/>\n(<i>Gives you a Spellwand</i>)<br/>\n<b>(possible outcome 4)</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Peaceful Pooka</strong>: Haha, off with you!<br/>\n(<i>Teleports you to the north of Feyrist</i>)<br/>\n<b>(possible outcome 5)</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Peaceful Pooka</strong>: Lucky one! I was searching for a babysitter and I'm sure you'll have a lot of fun taking care of my baby here!<br/>\n(<i>Summons a wild Rabbit</i>)<br/>\n<b>(possible outcome 6)</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Peaceful Pooka</strong>: You win! Take this present and have fun with it!<br/>\n(<i>Gives you an Explosive Present</i>)<br/>\n<b>(possible outcome 7)</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Peaceful Pooka</strong>: Haha, you lose! Thanks for the shiny coins, they are pretty!<br/>\n(<i>Takes coins? [not confirmed what he does]</i>)</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Peaceful Pooka</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":[],"pos":{"x":33529,"y":32237,"z":7}}